  "_about": [
    "What is where on each poster, used to say what a cluster region contains.",
    "Each element has a type (text, image, shape or background), a short label and one or more boxes.",
    "A box is [left, top, right, bottom] in percent of the visible poster (the poster without its letterbox bars), so 0 is the left/top edge and 100 the right/bottom edge.",
    "Where boxes overlap, a fixation belongs to the smallest box that contains it (for example text printed on a shape counts as the text).",
    "Fixations outside every box count as background. Edit freely: the website reads this file again whenever it changes.",
    "'titles' are the poster names the website shows."
